    "body": "Problem:\r\nThe Python module command bypasses standalone uv and pipx installations, and the configuration examples target Esbonio 0.16.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nLaunch the public Esbonio 2 CLI, recognize conf.py as a project root, and document the current project configuration model.\r\n\r\ni guess everybody who respects themselves already got `uv`?\r\n\r\nalso new esbonio starts with `esbonio serve`",
